{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1421113001:1":{"text":"あ、ありがとう！助かったよ！","source_cn":"谢、谢谢你们，多亏了你们救了我一命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033167333AE77606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1421113001":{"text":"あ、ありがとう！助かったよ！","source_cn":"谢、谢谢你们，多亏了你们救了我一命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033167333AE77606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421113002:1":{"text":"あれ、なんで名前を？おいらって、そんなに有名人だっけ？","source_cn":"嘿嘿，你们怎么知道？莫非我芬洛的大名已经传遍了萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D15DD549EA57EE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421113003:1":{"text":"……あなたがフェンリオね。どうして武器も持たずに狩りに出たの？","source_cn":"……原来你就是芬洛。出来打猎，怎么也不带上武器？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AD7375F8CCAD6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421113004:1":{"text":"いやいや！インドラじゃあるまいし、狩りなんて無理だよ！","source_cn":"我、我又不是因度厄那样的高手，哪敢打猎啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C02B72B770F2E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421113005:1":{"text":"毒のないシゲカサタケを採るついでに魚を釣って帰ろうと思っただけなのに、モンスターに出くわしちゃって……","source_cn":"我只是出来摘点无毒的茸茸伞菇顺便钓几条鱼，没想到就碰上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB19F76B1F23DD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421113006:1":{"text":"おいらの逃げ足がもう少し遅かったら、昨日の今頃はもうあいつのお腹の中だったよ……","source_cn":"要不是我跑得还算快，跟它周旋了一阵子，估计前两天就被吃了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC5198921FDE925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1421113006":{"text":"おいらの逃げ足がもう少し遅かったら、昨日の今頃はもうあいつのお腹の中だったよ……","source_cn":"要不是我跑得还算快，跟它周旋了一阵子，估计前两天就被吃了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC5198921FDE925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421113007:1":{"text":"うっ……逃げてる途中で落としたり、食べたりしちゃったから、また一から集め直しさ……","source_cn":"唉，丢了一些，逃命的时候吃了一些，如今又得从头开始……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE028DF7A27CD35E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421113008:1":{"text":"セレ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様！私たちも協力しましょう！","source_cn":"席蕾，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE0A6A9FD7C4A65F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"セレ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様！私たちも協力しましょう！","female":"セレ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様！私たちも協力しましょう！","variant_male_record_index":"162703","variant_female_record_index":"162704","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421113009:1":{"text":"キノコを採る行為が、こんなに危険だとは思いもしませんでしたわ！","source_cn":"我从来没想过，采摘最普通的蘑菇，也有可能会遭遇性命之危。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCD536F376B875A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421113010:1":{"text":"これがインドラ様の若い頃の暮らし……？それとも、平民の皆さんはずっとこんな日々を過ごして……？","source_cn":"这就是因度厄大人少年时的生活吗，还是大部分平民的日常呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x529BC12C35C7A370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421113011:1":{"text":"たぶん、後者だと思う……あなたの創作に役立つかもしれないし、経験してみるのも悪くないわね。","source_cn":"我想，应该是后者。所以，我们去体验一下吧——这样，也有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD40E2112EED1EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421113012:1":{"text":"なら早速行きましょう！まずはキノコ採り、その次に魚釣りですね！","source_cn":"就这么说定了，先去采茸茸伞菇，再去钓鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD9EB63F090C8472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421113013:1":{"text":"釣りまでしてくれるの！？さすがに悪いよ……","source_cn":"还要钓鱼吗？那怎么好意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x067997797734A6A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421113014:1":{"text":"あなたは何日も逃げ回っていたのでしょう？たくさん食べて元気になってくださいな！","source_cn":"芬洛先生困在野外好几天了，多吃点食物准没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1428816560756717","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421113015:1":{"text":"あ、ありがとう！それじゃ、君たちが戻るまでおいらはここで休んでるね。","source_cn":"那……那就多谢你们了！我……我先在这休息下，等你们回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6F64C9EB60D804D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"集めた食料は？","source_cn":"那你摘的食物呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x720B39DFB15CC5DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"集めた食料は？","female":"集めた食料は？","variant_male_record_index":"72326","variant_female_record_index":"72327","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"君がフェンリオか？","source_cn":"你是芬洛吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6A59ECB085283A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"君がフェンリオか？","female":"あなたがフェンリオなの？","variant_male_record_index":"72324","variant_female_record_index":"72325","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芬洛":{"text":"フェンリオ","source":"芬洛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:席蕾":{"text":"セレ","source":"席蕾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧蒂薇":{"text":"オルデア","source":"欧蒂薇","status":"matche